{"id":"morocco-atlas-sahara","title":"Morocco: Atlas to Sahara","who":"Classic route · southern Morocco by motorcycle","when":"Best March–May and October–November","vehicle":"Adventure motorcycle, 7–10 days","kind":"moto","color":"#dc2626","summary":"From Marrakech over the High Atlas by the Tizi n'Tichka, past kasbahs and film-set Ouarzazate, through the Dades and Todra gorges to the dunes of Merzouga, and back by the Draa valley palm groves. Tarmac for most, with endless dirt tracks for those who want them.","sources":[{"label":"Mosko Moto: lightweight dual-sport route across Morocco (November 2025)","url":"https://moskomoto.com/blogs/mosko-moto-blog/trip-report-lightweight-dual-sport-route-across-morocco"},{"label":"Rider Magazine: Morocco adventure tour review (March 2025)","url":"https://ridermagazine.com/2025/03/07/imtbike-morocco-adventure-motorcycle-tour-review/"}],"approximate":"The usual loop and overnight towns.","km":1602,"bbox":[-7.9895,30.0298,-4.0143,31.6259],"stops":[{"name":"Marrakech","place":"Marrakech, Morocco","at":[31.6258,-7.9892],"text":"Bikes collected, the Jemaa el-Fnaa square at night.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Djemaa_el_Fna.jpg/500px-Djemaa_el_Fna.jpg","page":"Jemaa el-Fnaa","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Djemaa_el_Fna.jpg","credit":"Boris Macek","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Tizi n'Tichka","place":"Tizi n'Tichka","at":[31.2861,-7.3811],"text":"Morocco's highest main road pass, 2,260 m, in big loops over the High Atlas.","source":{"label":"Rider Magazine (2025)","url":"https://ridermagazine.com/2025/03/07/imtbike-morocco-adventure-motorcycle-tour-review/"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Tizi_n%27Tichka.jpg/500px-Tizi_n%27Tichka.jpg","page":"Tizi n'Tichka","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tizi_n%27Tichka.jpg","credit":"AbdelCharaf","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Aït Benhaddou","place":"Aït Benhaddou, Mo